# Purpose:
# Build, test, and deploy a frontend application
# to AWS S3, then invalidate CloudFront cache
# so users receive the latest version immediately.
#
# Deployment Flow:
# 1. Checkout source code
# 2. Install dependencies
# 3. Run tests
# 4. Build frontend assets
# 5. Authenticate with AWS
# 6. Upload build files to S3
# 7. Clear CloudFront cache
# 8. Display deployment summary